      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's happening so much lately and i can't explain it. like yesterday i was thinking about my old friend leo and then literally 5 minutes later i get a text from a random number and it's him. then today i saw 11:11 on my phone, then my watch said 11:11, then a car drove past with a license plate that had 11 in it. it feels like the world is reacting to my thoughts. can you help me figure out the math on how often something like this actually happens by chance?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
